                                                "sense_id": "46ed0596-9ae1-32e0-9192-2c22d99eb05f",
                                                "text": "And as for kindred , there is no Alliance neerer vnto any one, than their Countrey , that is to be vnto vs another God, and our prime and deareſt Parent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e96c08e-4d41-46fe-8670-967610dd952d",
